cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, with the release date."
type: dataset
title: "Small Print record of MCP server, skill and plugin small print"
abstract: >-
  A nightly record of the published tool descriptions, schemas and instructions of MCP servers,
  agent skills and plugins, released as metadata only: entry identities, version strings and
  publish dates, content hashes, tool counts, per-change metadata with the grading rule that
  matched, per-day change counts, advisory identifiers matched to version ranges, install counts
  with their source, and the record's hash chain. It holds no third-party text.
authors:
  - name: "EmberStack LLC"
    website: "https://smallprint.dev"
version: "2026.09.29"
date-released: 2026-09-29
url: "https://smallprint.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gostanos/smallprint-dataset"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - "model context protocol"
  - "MCP servers"
  - "agent skills"
  - "plugins"
  - "software supply chain"
  - "security advisories"
  - "content hashes"
